MODULE paths

FUNCTION derive application paths from settings
    make the existing base directory absolute and resolve its symbolic links
    resolve every configured path beneath it
    derive the versioned package store, digest cache, and receipt directory
    require every result to be a child of the base directory without existing
        symbolic-link components
    require configured roots and the lockfile not to overlap
    return all application paths

FUNCTION validate portable identifier or version
    accept only the documented path-safe character set
    otherwise report the field and rejected value

FUNCTION resolve contained path
    reject absolute, empty, current-directory, and parent-traversal values
    join the value to the root
    require the result to remain beneath the root
    reject every existing symbolic-link component from root through result
    return the contained path

FUNCTION identify regular file
    return true only when the path exists as a regular file
